HakiOS fragment: Tecno Spark 20 Pro (KJ6)
Hardware-specific values must be verified on the actual device.
CONFIG_DEVICE="kj6"

Touchscreen: fts_ts, controller transport not yet confirmed
Do not enable HAKIOS_TCM until the KJ6 driver is identified.
CONFIG_HAKIOS_TCM=y
Buttons/fingerprint/key input not yet mapped
CONFIG_BUTTONS=0

Helio G99: 2x Cortex-A76 + 6x Cortex-A55
CPU frequency driver is not ported yet.
CONFIG_MTK_CPUFREQ=0

Mali-G57 MC2; driver not yet ported
CONFIG_MALI=y
CONFIG_MALI_MHZ=0

KJ6 display: 1080x2460, 120 Hz
Scale and fit values must be verified with the framebuffer.
CONFIG_FBSCALE=1
CONFIG_FBFIT=0
CONFIG_FB_QUEUE=1
CONFIG_FB_FLIP=y
CONFIG_FB_INUSE=y
CONFIG_SURF_ALIGN=y
CONFIG_SURF_LOCKWAIT=y
SCP/sensor hub not yet ported
CONFIG_SCP_STEP=0

CONNSYS/Wi-Fi not yet ported
CONFIG_CONNSYS_STEP=0

Do not assume a touchscreen boot argument yet
CONFIG_BOOTARGS=""
